  <data name="AdHocLanguageParameterType.FieldDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Blank = en-US. The date and number format of the results (en-US: 8/15/2014; en-GB: 15/08/2014; en-CA: 2014-08-15). Warning: it also controls how filter dates in the definition are read. If you copied the JSON from Query in the web view, set Locale to match your browser language (e.g. en-GB), or a filter date such as 01/07/2017 may be read with day and month swapped.</value>
